  (text "What this does: Measures the magnetic field for heading and roll, read at 100 Hz and logged. Non-essential:\nit never gates the watchdog or the estimator (D-2Nov.11).\nConnects to: FLIGHT_3V3 through R3701 -> MAG_3V3; I2C3 (PA8 MAG_SCL, PC9 MAG_SDA) and MAG_INT (PE6) on 02-flight-mcu."
