  (text "22 ohm link, not 47: VDD's minimum is 2.8 V and the SET/RESET pulses come through the link (D-2Nov.11).\nC3701 is the SET/RESET reservoir, at CAP (pin 10); C3702 / C3703 at VDD (pin 2); C3704 at VDDIO (pin 13).\nI2C only: SPI_CS tied to VDDIO; SDO and the NC pads unconnected. Address 0x30. Pull-ups go to FLIGHT_3V3."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 15.24 165.1 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "94395e7f-f01f-55e2-ab08-ced2ad2d71a8"))
  (text "Placement: layout guide C09a. Footprint: KiCad's MEMSIC LGA-16 3 x 3 mm pattern (made from the MMC5883MA\ndrawing); check its pads against the MMC5983MA drawing before layout."
